    straight rays extending from the center. Rays continue across 2-rails; the
    rails and original 3x3 object are preserved. At a crossing, extend the
    highlight one cell on both sides of a rail as shown by the examples.
    """
    h, w = len(grid), len(grid[0])
    out = [row[:] for row in grid]
    for r in range(1, h-1):
        for c in range(1, w-1):
